{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"cb9c19aa175ab053","type":"text","text":"# 📘 CMake Cheat Sheet for DLL Workflow\n\n## 🔧 Project Setup\n- `cmake_minimum_required(VERSION x.y)`  \n  Ensure minimum CMake version.\n\n- `project(MyProject LANGUAGES CXX)`  \n  Define project name and language.\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Targets\n- `add_library(name SHARED sources...)`  \n  Create a DLL/shared library target.\n\n- `add_executable(name sources...)`  \n  Create an executable target.\n\n- `target_link_libraries(target PRIVATE|PUBLIC deps...)`  \n  Link dependencies to a target.\n\n- `target_include_directories(target PUBLIC|PRIVATE dirs...)`  \n  Add include paths for headers.  \n  - `$<BUILD_INTERFACE:...>` → source tree paths.  \n  - `$<INSTALL_INTERFACE:...>` → install tree paths.\n\n- `target_compile_definitions(target ...)`  \n  Add preprocessor definitions (e.g., `MYLIB_EXPORTS` for DLL export macros).\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ Build & Test\n- `enable_testing()`  \n  Enable CTest integration.\n\n- `add_test(NAME name COMMAND target)`  \n  Register a test executable with CTest.\n\n---\n\n## 📥 Installation & Export\n- `install(TARGETS target EXPORT ExportName ...)`  \n  Install binaries, libraries, and headers.\n\n- `install(DIRECTORY include/ DESTINATION include)`  \n  Install header files.\n\n- `install(EXPORT ExportName FILE ExportName.cmake DESTINATION cmake)`  \n  Export targets so consumers can use `find_package`.\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ CLI Commands\n- **Configure project**  \n  ```bash\n  cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n  cmake --build build --config Release\n  cd build && ctest --output-on-failure\n  cmake --install build --prefix output\n\n","x":-8480,"y":-4840,"width":640,"height":1420}
	],
	"edges":[]
}